alse},{"turn":15,"said":"Hello, and welcome back. Most of us spend hours every week in meetings, and a lot of that time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":713.5672089999971,"totalMs":713.5729169999977,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":559.6733749999985,"totalMs":559.6829159999979,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":568.627457999999,"totalMs":568.6376249999994,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":554.7619589999995,"totalMs":554.7676250000004,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Cut — recording stopped.","calls":[{"na