abit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":612.3406670000004,"totalMs":612.3503339999988,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":603.9631249999984,"totalMs":603.9725419999995,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":620.7002500000017,"totalMs":620.7084170000016,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I'll stay quiet during your take.","calls":[],"decisionMs":607.4800410000025,"totalMs":607.4882910000015,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Cut — recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","argume